>> Animal := Kipengee mpya.
>> Factory := Kipengee mpya.

Animal ikija: ['mpya'] fanya: {
	>> animal := binafsi mpya.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal ikija: ['sound:'] fanya: { :s
	yangu sound := s.
}.

Animal ikija: ['sound'] fanya: { <- yangu sound.
}.

>> Dog := Kipengee mpya.
>> Cat := Kipengee mpya.

Dog ikija: ['mpya'] fanya: { <- Animal mpya sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat ikija: ['mpya'] fanya: { <- Animal mpya sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Towe andika: Dog mpya sound, mstari-mpya.
Towe andika: Cat mpya sound, mstari-mpya.

Factory ikija: ['mix:and:'] fanya: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal mpya sound: (
		( beast1 sound kutoka: 0 urefu: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound kutoka: 2 urefu: 5 )
	).
}.

Towe andika: (Factory mix: Dog mpya and: Cat mpya) sound, mstari-mpya.
